<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom TeleNotes rate set at 8.73 pct.</title>
<headline>Telecom TeleNotes rate set at 8.73 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead manager CS First Boston said on Tuesday the rate set for a TeleNote issue by Telecom Corp of New Zealand unit TCNZ Finance Ltd was struck at a yield of 8.73 percent.</p>
<p>Telecom on Monday announced it had placed NZ$225 million of TeleNotes to wholesale investors and a further $50 million was available to retail investors.</p>
<p>The TeleNotes mature March 15, 2004.</p>
<p>Government 4/04 bonds are yielding 8.01 percent in the secondary market.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
